    {"id":"map2t","type":"text","x":505,"y":515,"width":410,"height":180,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":23,"version":1,"versionNonce":23,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1700000000,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":14,"fontFamily":2,"text":"МАППИНГ — deriveQSeverity()\nfile: applicability.go\n\n  count(C+I+A) = 0  →  0.30\n  count(C+I+A) = 1  →  0.50\n  count(C+I+A) = 2  →  0.70\n  count(C+I+A) = 3  →  0.90\n\nЧем больше из C/I/A нарушает —\nтем хуже последствия.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":"map2","originalText":"МАППИНГ — deriveQSeverity()\nfile: applicability.go\n\n  count(C+I+A) = 0  →  0.30\n  count(C+I+A) = 1  →  0.50\n  count(C+I+A) = 2  →  0.70\n  count(C+I+A) = 3  →  0.90\n\nЧем больше из C/I/A нарушает —\nтем хуже последствия.","lineHeight":1.25},

